## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:01_user_registration
Failure Analysis1: Registration redirects to dashboard instead of login
Improvement Guidance1: Modify registration flow to redirect to login after success. Ensure consistent authentication state handling. Add proper flash messages for user feedback.
Failure Analysis2: Registration page fails to load
Improvement Guidance2: Verify `<a href="{{ url_for('register') }}">` in `base.html`. Ensure `register.html` properly extends `base.html`. Check Flask route (`/register`) for correct `render_template()`.

2. |Case|:03_view_movie_recommendations
Failure Analysis1: Only 1 movie shown instead of top 5
Improvement Guidance1: Verify file reading logic in FileHandler. Ensure proper sorting by rating. Check template rendering of recommendations.
Failure Analysis2: No recommendations displayed
Improvement Guidance2: Ensure `movies.txt` exists and has correct permissions. Verify `index.html` correctly loops through `recommendations`. Add error handling if `movies.txt` is empty.

